provisioningMode: efs-ap → automatically creates a new EFS Access Point per PVC

fileSystemId → your main EFS File System ID

directoryPerms → sets default permissions for created directory

Retain → EFS directory/data won’t be deleted when PVC is removed

✅ With this setup, no need to create PV manually —
Kubernetes dynamically handles it using CSI.

